      "created_at": "2015-02-12T18:25:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone,</p><p>I played with Omnitron-X for the first time yesterday and I have a philosophical question about the Slip Through Time card. I know that we can't use the same power twice, but why can't we do it with this card ? If Omnitron-X is slipping through time, why can't we use his power again... he's going back in time after all ! Well... what's your thought on this ?</p><p>Thanks !</p>",
