      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jimb/{size}/2093_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-08T06:34:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"metaphysician\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/edb3f5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> metaphysician:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Too many damage types to block, and Devastating Aurora.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Eh, for the most part you can get away with “Elemental Exochassis,” which means he’s only about as screwed as everyone else is once “Devastating Aurora” gets drawn.  Slightly less, maybe, with all the shuffle-your-trash effects he has.</p>",
