      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/{size}/2107_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-08T06:43:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I world go with elemental plating against dawn covers most of her worst damage dealers and herself. I also find his base power helps quick setup and recovery.</p>\n<p>As for Spite OX brings quick card play to neutralize the bounce effect. Just being able to abuse slip throught time over and over. If you manage to keep EDU in play you can cover for the whole team.</p>\n<p>I juste love OX and Iron Legacy is pretty much the only one that really scares me.</p>",
